  "original_excerpt": "POSSIBLY SAFE when used orally and appropriately, short-term. Ashwagandha has been used with apparent safety in doses of up to 1250 mg daily for up to 6 months (3710, 11301, 19271, 90649, 90652, 90653, 97292, 101816, 102682, 102683) (102684, 102685, 102687, 103476, 105824, 109586, 109588, 109589, 109590, 116648)(118927, 118930). ...when used topically. Ashwagandha lotion has been used with apparent safety in concentrations up to 8% for up to 2 months (111538).",
